    "steps":[
      ["Marinate","Toss the chicken with the garlic, spices, olive oil and lemon juice until well coated."],
      ["Cook the chicken","Lay on a sheet pan and bake or air fry at 200 °C (400 °F) for 20 minutes, then broil 3–4 minutes to char. Rest 4–5 minutes, chop into cubes and toss in the pan juices."],
      ["Start the rice","Melt the butter and cook the garlic and onion over medium-low for 5–6 minutes until soft. Add the turmeric, paprika, salt and rice and toast 2–3 minutes."],
      ["Simmer","Add the water, bring to a light bubble, cover and simmer 10–12 minutes until cooked, stirring once halfway."],
      ["Sauce","Mix the yogurt, mayo, honey, salt, pepper and garlic powder, then add pickle juice to the consistency you like."],
      ["Slaw","Toss the onion, tomatoes, gherkins and parsley with the salt, pepper and sumac."],
      ["Assemble","Divide the rice and chicken between 5 containers and top with slaw and garlic sauce."]
